OL,3,AUS fans with Ed Sheeran tickets are
OL,4,Aleft torn by Macklemore controversy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe snowballing controversy over
OL,7,Fpro-Palestinian rapper Macklemore being
OL,8,Fdropped as a support act for Ed Sheeran
OL,9,Fhas plunged the tour into crisis and
OL,10,Fleft concert-goers in the middle of the
OL,11,Ffraught Israel-Gaza debate.
OL,13,FFans who spoke to the BBC - including
OL,14,Fthose who have tickets to see Sheeran's
OL,15,Fnext show - have been split since
OL,16,FMacklemore was dropped from the Loop
OL,17,FTour this week after his "free
OL,18,FPalestine" protest on stage.
OL,20,FAll of Sheeran's opening acts have
OL,21,Fsince quit in solidarity.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
